&lt;p&gt;Our approach is integrated within the &lt;a href=&#34;https://aif360.res.ibm.com&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;IBM AIF 360 tool&lt;/a&gt;. See a demo notebook &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Trusted-AI/AIF360/blob/main/examples/demo_FACTS.ipynb&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
